{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Run one Firefox build stage: 'patch' runs inline via apply_patch (no-op `already` on a patched tree); 'repatch' runs inline via repatch (restores the pristine backup, then applies the CURRENT v2 block - the update path); 'rebuild' = repatch inline, then the detached build stage (incremental; the one-click path after an nsDocShell_v2_block.cpp update). download/extract/configure/deps/build/package/clean/all launch detached via setsid, logging to workspace/build.log with the pid recorded. Every launch first refreshes the build kit from the library assets (materialize_kit), so a stale workspace script can never run. 'all' chains the Noobscape v2 mechanism in: download/extract/patch/deps via build.sh, then the Rust apply_patch through `newbound exec`, then build — gated on the NoobscapeStartWatcher marker being present in nsDocShell.cpp. Refuses to stack a stage while one is running.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse std::process::{Command, Stdio};\nuse std::fs::File;\nuse std::path::Path;","params":[{"name":"stage","type":"String"}],"returntype":"JSONObject","type":"rust"},"id":"qquzjv1a03ddd9cc1y28","readers":[],"time":1788635861371,"username":"system","writers":[]}